  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "應用文學理寫作與鑑賞",
    "sub_ename": "THE THEORIES, PRACTICES AND APPRECIATION OF PRACTICAL WRITING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程學理、習作、鑑賞並重。教導應用文定義、特性、範疇、功用及寫作原則，再分述書信、題辭、對聯、柬帖、便條與名片之意義、用途、分類，或用語、構造、作法，舉例說明並習作。其中書信、題辭、對聯，更擇古今名作分析其意蘊深厚之人文藝術之美。分組進行人物採訪、企畫書撰寫、簡報製作暨報告，以創新教學專案導向式學習，令學生感受人情經典之美，並增進協同合作、蒐集資料、閱讀、思辨、採訪、踏查、口語表達暨寫作各項能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course emphasizes on theories, practices and appreciation. By ways of illustration, it primarily aims to introduce the characteristics, categories, functions, and the writing principles of various types of practical writing, which includes letters, inscriptions, invitations, notes, business cards, and official documents. To internalize the notions covered in class, students will additionally be offered abundant opportunities to compose those types of practical writing in the ways that are deemed to be grammatically correct and authentically appropriated.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能理解授課內容、並能撰寫運用暨鑑賞。",
      "describe_en": "To be able to understand learning materials and apply theories to practices."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "具備協同合作，蒐集資料、閱讀、思辨、討論、口語表達、書寫暨鑑賞各項能力。",
      "describe_en": "To develop abilities to collaborate, to collect research data, to interpretively speculate the readings, to interpersonally discuss ideas, to express themselves, to write and to appreciate."
    }
  ],
